OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 31 MAY
OL,4,G1900FSunday Feature: The Messy Guide
OL,5,     Fto AI
OL,6,     GComposer Jennifer Walshe explores
OL,7,     Gthe philosophical and aesthetic
OL,8,     Gquestions that AI raises for how
OL,9,     Gwe make, listen to and think
OL,10,     Gabout music.
OL,11,G1945FWords and Music
OL,12,     GWords about Marilyn Monroe, Helen
OL,13,     Gof Troy and a host of other
OL,14,     Gbeauties both real and imagined
OL,15,     Gby Sappho, Austen, Oscar Wilde.
OL,16,     GAnd music to match from
OL,17,     GTchaikovsky, Bach, Judith Weir.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
